  "_overridesNote": "Security overrides, last reviewed 2026-09-15. sharp is pinned at ^0.35.4 because GHSA-rgj7-g3m4-5g8c (libheif) affects <0.35.4, and sharp arrives transitively through next rather than as a direct dependency, so an override is the only way to raise it. nanoid ^3.3.18 is the patched line. postcss uses $postcss so the override cannot drift from the direct devDependency. REVIEW THIS NOTE, NOT JUST THE VERSIONS: the previous text said next carried no advisory of its own and that 16.2.12 was the latest stable, and by 2026-09-15 both were false — next 16.2.12 had two CRITICAL RCE advisories (GHSA-p293-qw3h-jr36, GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4) fixed in 16.3.3, with 16.3.5 current. An accurate note with no date reads as current long after it stops being true. Check ./scripts/gates.sh security rather than trusting this paragraph.",
